## 6. Repository and Hosting Independence

The BASE Tier 2 Creator Template v1 is designed so that repository configuration and public deployment location may be configured independently.

A Creator Deployment may use compatible repositories, hosting providers, private infrastructure, domains, or other compatible deployment environments.

The public location of a Creator Deployment does not itself determine ownership of, or rights to, the repository or Tier 2 Software.

Moving a Creator Deployment between compatible hosting providers, repositories, domains, or deployment environments does not transfer ownership of the Tier 2 Software and does not alter the restrictions of this License.

